      "message": "test(app): the fig8 pocket pass-start pin moves to the heavy lane with a light twin\n\nfig8_pocket_outside_starts_each_level_at_the_stock_edge takes 94 s in\ndebug on main (two generations: Waterline and Offset rings). It now\ncarries the heavy-lane ignore and keeps all its asserts. Its light twin\nfig8_pocket_outside_starts_each_level_at_the_stock_edge_light checks the\nsame law on Waterline only (44.5 s debug, 3.6 s release).\n\nFixes #3587\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
